## 🏗️ MongoDB Collections Architecture

To optimize performance and minimize database lookups, this design uses **4 core collections**. Related data (like quiz questions or flashcards) are **embedded** directly into their parent documents, while data that grows indefinitely (like chat history) or operates independently (like schedules) are kept in separate collections.

---

### 1. `users` Collection

Stores core authentication and user profile data.

